  "al(9,2))) from (`laborywert` `w` join `laboryus` `u` on(`w`.`UsID` = `u`.`ID`)) where `u`.`Pat_id` = `n`.`Pat_ID` and `w`.`Abkü` regexp '^hba[1c]' and `w`.`Wert` regexp '^[0-9]+\\.?[0-9]*$' and `w`.`Wert` < 21) AS `max2` from `namen` `n`"
